# Hospital Management System

## Overview

A simple hospital management system developed using Java and Object-Oriented Programming concepts. The project includes basic GUI elements and focuses on managing hospital entities such as patients and doctors.

## Features

* user Roles (Admin, Patient, Doctor, etc..)
* Basic GUI interface
* OOP-based structure

## Technologies Used

* Java
* Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
* GUI Development

## My Contribution

I worked on building the core OOP structure, including classes such as Patient and Doctor, and contributed to the basic system implementation.

## Learning Outcomes

Through this project, I improved my understanding of:

* OOP concepts
* Java programming
* System structure design
* Team collaboration
